Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:23.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:27.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Auntie Stella and the guys\Nat the construction site are okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.33,0:00:34.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Looks like the guild\Nmade it through somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.50,0:00:46.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since I've taken\Na good look at this signboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.88,0:00:48.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,An adventurer, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.79,0:00:51.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,You didn't get one decent skill?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.79,0:00:54.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,You spent a full three-month term\Npracticing at every training school,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.96,0:00:56.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,and you couldn't get a single one?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.58,0:01:03.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Noor, sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.96,0:01:06.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,but I can't let you register\Nas an adventurer like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.50,0:01:14.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I never imagined I'd reunite\Nwith my instructors from back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.17,0:01:19.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I last saw them, what,\Nfifteen years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.08,0:02:53.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Clays Royal Capital - 15 Years Ago
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.54,0:02:56.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let me train as a swordsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.50,0:02:57.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Train?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.21,0:02:59.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.67,0:03:02.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you have a permit from\Nthe Adventurer's Guild?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.67,0:03:05.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I just got one from the guildmaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.63,0:03:09.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,The training is intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.50,0:03:11.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you prepared to bear with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.63,0:03:12.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.50,0:03:18.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.08,0:03:21.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow's going to be even more intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.13,0:03:32.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,He'll be lucky to last three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.79,0:03:40.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's day 10 now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.13,0:03:44.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,At the very least, the tenacity of this kid\Nis definitely nothing to scoff at.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.42,0:03:47.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.42,0:03:52.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.75,0:04:03.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Never drop your sword,\Neven if you break a bone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.17,0:04:05.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,The enemy will not wait for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.33,0:04:14.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hard to believe his eyes\Nare still so full of vigor
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.83,0:04:17.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,after getting his body and\Nmind put through the wringer!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.46,0:04:21.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,This kid might actually have\Na promising future.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.71,0:04:24.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.38,0:04:28.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,When will I get to learn a skill?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.33,0:04:30.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,That isn't something I decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.92,0:04:34.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can you at least show me\Nwhat kind of skill I might get?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.50,0:04:56.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,How was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.04,0:04:57.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,A-amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.67,0:04:59.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I couldn't see most of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.42,0:05:00.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.04,0:05:05.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's a swift-foot technique that makes\Nmy slashes difficult for even me to follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.63,0:05:08.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,A boy like this probably\Ncouldn't even see me with his bare eyes-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.42,0:05:10.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,You kept the same rhythm the entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.08,0:05:12.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Like whoosh, slash, sa-sa-slash!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.67,0:05:14.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Steady like a clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.83,0:05:17.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoosh, slash, sa-sa-slash!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.83,0:05:22.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoosh, slash, sa-sa-slash!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.00,0:05:24.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoosh, slash, sa-sa-slash!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.00,0:05:25.67,Q2,,0,0,0,,Such latent potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.00,0:05:25.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoosh, slash, sa-sa-slash!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.67,0:05:26.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,If nurtured properly, he could match me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.54,0:05:27.96,Q2,,0,0,0,,If nurtured properly, he could match me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.54,0:05:27.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoosh, slash, sa-sa-slash!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.96,0:05:29.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,no, surpass me, even!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.96,0:05:29.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoosh, slash, sa-sa-slash!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.00,0:05:29.79,Q2,,0,0,0,,no, surpass me, even!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.71,0:05:33.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(166.4,194.4)}{\an7}2 Months After\N{\pos(153.6,244.8)}{\an7}Training Started
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.46,0:05:32.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,How strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.83,0:05:35.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.38,0:05:40.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why hasn't he been able\Nto learn a skill aside from Parry?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.25,0:05:42.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,All he needs is one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.54,0:05:45.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just one skill that\Ncould be considered useful...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.96,0:05:48.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(166.4,194.4)}{\an7}3 Months After\N{\pos(153.6,244.8)}{\an7}Training Started
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.96,0:05:48.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.58,0:05:49.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.79,0:05:51.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait! Just give me a little longer-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.54,0:05:52.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's no point.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.42,0:05:54.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Going any further would\Nbe a waste of your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.25,0:05:59.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry isn't enough for someone\Nto make it as a swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.63,0:06:00.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Alas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.79,0:06:03.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,It seems Swordsmanship is the one thing\Nhe didn't have the aptitude for.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.88,0:06:07.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it would be better\Nif you chose another path.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.33,0:06:11.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your talent may be found\Nin another training school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.63,0:06:16.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sure there's another path\Nfor this child.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.67,0:06:19.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.00,0:06:22.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you serious about taking part\Nin my training regiment, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.92,0:06:25.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,The swordsman instructor\Ntold me to try somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.83,0:06:27.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sig did, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.54,0:06:30.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I had heard he was looking\Nafter some kid, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.67,0:06:34.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,He looks small enough\Nto get blown away by a light breeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.33,0:06:36.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want to be an adventurer,\Nno matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.13,0:06:40.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,The role of a warrior is\Nto become the shield for their allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.50,0:06:41.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,You understand that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.83,0:06:43.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.79,0:06:47.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,All right, let's give it a go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.00,0:06:50.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(153.6,432)}{\an7}2 Months After\N{\pos(140.8,482.4)}{\an7}Training Started
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.92,0:06:59.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll give the boy credit,\NI never thought he'd get this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.38,0:07:16.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Damn, talk about being tough AND gutsy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.29,0:07:18.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,If he just acquired a skill,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.00,0:07:20.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I could raise this kid\Nto be a literal invincible shield...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.38,0:07:25.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(908.8,432)}{\an7}3 Months After\N{\pos(896,482.4)}{\an7}Training Started
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.00,0:07:25.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.42,0:07:27.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.38,0:07:29.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I acknowledge your efforts,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.42,0:07:34.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,but what you have acquired is a slight\Nimprovement of your physical abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.21,0:07:38.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you force yourself to continue on,\Nyou will lose your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.88,0:07:41.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know it sucks, but you gotta move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.13,0:07:43.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's toughed it out more than most.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.96,0:07:46.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,He deserves to be where\Nhis efforts will get rewarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.92,0:07:48.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please let me train here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.88,0:07:50.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,You really wanna do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.75,0:07:51.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.88,0:07:53.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, if you insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.92,0:07:55.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.79,0:07:57.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Try to throw it over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.50,0:07:59.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,That sure is far.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.75,0:08:01.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.63,0:08:04.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,After he misses, I'll just make up\Na random reason to reject him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.96,0:08:07.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can already tell he'll be the\Ntroublesome type of studen-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.25,0:08:09.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Was that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.42,0:08:11.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.96,0:08:14.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.54,0:08:15.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.67,0:08:17.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is the exact opposite of perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.75,0:08:25.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Instructor, why am I doing nothing\Nbut throwing stones?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.88,0:08:28.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Because I just know\Nyou're gonna be trouble, duh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.08,0:08:30.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wanna use a bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.17,0:08:40.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, get a good grip on it\Nand then assume the shooting position.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.96,0:08:43.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,A good grip? Like thi-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.75,0:08:46.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why'd it break?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.29,0:08:48.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's what I was afraid of...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.79,0:08:55.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Give me a break already, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.67,0:08:59.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're all out of training bows now,\Nso just use mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.63,0:09:01.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,This one shouldn't break\Nno matter how strong he-
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.63,0:09:08.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just stick to throwing stones, got it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.50,0:09:09.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.21,0:09:13.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(140.8,432)}{\an7}2 Months After\N{\pos(128,482.4)}{\an7}Training Started
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.00,0:09:18.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Where did you learn to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.21,0:09:19.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nobody taught me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.54,0:09:21.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is just how I've always hunted birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.21,0:09:23.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,The super colorful ones\Nthat like to swoop down from the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.25,0:09:24.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,to grab mountain rabbits.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.79,0:09:27.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding me...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.42,0:09:29.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's a thunderflash!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.50,0:09:35.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's difficult for even a seasoned hunter\Nwith a superior bow
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.79,0:09:37.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,to bring those things down...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.42,0:09:40.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Although, I could totally do it\Nwith my eyes closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.17,0:09:47.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is there any point in him being here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.75,0:09:49.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your term is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.33,0:09:50.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(153.6,194.4)}{\an7}3 Months After\N{\pos(140.8,244.8)}{\an7}Training Started
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.46,0:09:50.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.67,0:09:53.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?! But I haven't learned anything ye-
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.13,0:09:57.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,You totally lack the sense\Nto handle any sort of delicate weaponry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.46,0:09:59.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just settle for throwing stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.04,0:10:04.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Such a pain in the butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.63,0:10:08.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,You've already got enough to hack it\Neven without a bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.04,0:10:12.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.17,0:10:14.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're the Noor I've heard about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.67,0:10:15.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure, why not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.67,0:10:17.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh? Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.46,0:10:20.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Come with me.\NWe're starting right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.96,0:10:26.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sense the enemy's presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.08,0:10:29.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,And sneak up on them\Nwithout making a single sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.33,0:10:34.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,He isn't bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.92,0:10:40.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.17,0:10:41.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.29,0:10:43.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,You'll have to do better than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.08,0:10:46.13,Q3,,0,0,0,,There are various traps\Nrigged along this corridor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.33,0:10:48.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Avoid falling into any of those traps
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.63,0:10:51.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,and make your way to this\Nhard-to-open treasure chest!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.63,0:10:53.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Avoid the traps, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.46,0:10:54.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.54,0:11:05.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.17,0:11:10.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stone Throw!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.71,0:11:13.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.50,0:11:14.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.25,0:11:17.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,he's missing the point of the exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.54,0:11:20.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,You failed to dismantle the traps\Nleading to the treasure chest
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.96,0:11:21.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(883.2,194.4)}{\an7}3 Months After\N{\pos(870.4,244.8)}{\an7}Training Started
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.88,0:11:23.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,and your situational awareness\Nis poorly lacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.50,0:11:25.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,There is no hope of you becoming a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.42,0:11:31.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,But even so, this boy has stamina\Nand tenacity that is beyond comparison.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.42,0:11:33.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Those are good qualities to have.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.29,0:11:36.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,If he ever gives up on becoming an\Nadventurer,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.25,0:11:39.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll extend him an invite to join\Nthe royal capital's intelligence agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.54,0:11:42.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh ho?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.13,0:11:45.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're quite a young applicant,\Naren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.50,0:11:49.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sure there was an age requirement\Nof at least 15 years old...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.46,0:11:51.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I got a permit from the Guildmaster,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.88,0:11:54.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,and I've already trained\Nat the other schools.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.13,0:11:56.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,It didn't work out, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.75,0:11:58.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.63,0:12:02.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(908.8,259.2)}{\an7}2 Months After\N{\pos(896,309.6)}{\an7}Training Started
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.83,0:12:10.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, it seems the reason\Nyou struggle to use magic
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.42,0:12:13.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,is because there's no mana\Nflowing through you in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.00,0:12:14.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why doesn't it flow through me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.08,0:12:17.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you were just born that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.58,0:12:19.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,In which case,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.17,0:12:23.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,the only hope of changing that is for you\Nto go inside the Mana Resonance Room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.46,0:12:25.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mana Reso-what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.88,0:12:28.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let me give it a shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.29,0:12:33.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.33,0:12:36.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,But leave immediately\Nif it starts feeling too intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.25,0:12:41.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,He hasn't come out yet?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.08,0:12:41.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.88,0:12:43.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Th-that isn't good!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.29,0:12:46.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,That room drastically amplifies\Nall of the human senses
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.83,0:12:48.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,and he's been in there for days?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.33,0:12:49.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,It could kill him if we're not careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.67,0:12:54.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Noor!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.67,0:12:55.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.79,0:12:58.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,A-are you okay?\NAnything wrong with your body?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.92,0:13:00.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.29,0:13:01.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't interrupt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.79,0:13:03.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm close\Nto having a breakthrough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.46,0:13:05.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.71,0:13:12.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is the only spell I learned...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.75,0:13:12.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(883.2,194.4)}{\an7}3 Months After\N{\pos(870.4,244.8)}{\an7}Training Started
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.04,0:13:13.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh ho.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.54,0:13:17.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's astonishing that Tiny Flame\Nis all you've gotten after months of training.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.38,0:13:21.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's rare to see people\Nas incapable of magic as you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.83,0:13:25.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, given your lack of mana,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.83,0:13:29.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,it's actually impressive\Nhow far you've come.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.17,0:13:31.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.54,0:13:33.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Am I seeing this right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.50,0:13:35.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-is he dual casting?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.58,0:13:38.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,It took me 50 years to get to that point,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.58,0:13:41.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,yet he managed it on his own\Nin just three months?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.00,0:13:46.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,This won't help me be an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.42,0:13:49.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Indeed it won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.92,0:13:53.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Turns out this isn't\Nthe place for you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.04,0:13:55.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's such a pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.75,0:13:58.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,He has so much talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.63,0:14:00.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,If only his body\Nwas more attuned to magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.50,0:14:04.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,he could have been known through\Nthe land as an unparalleled magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.96,0:14:09.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,First, let me ask you:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.13,0:14:12.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did you undergo the rite of blessing\Nwhen you were a still a small child?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.29,0:14:14.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,The rite? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.54,0:14:18.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Only students who were selected\Nin advance and undergo that rite
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.25,0:14:19.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,can train at this school.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.71,0:14:21.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.08,0:14:24.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not leaving until you agree\Nto let me train here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.88,0:14:28.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do as you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.92,0:14:49.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not leaving until you agree\Nto let me train here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.75,0:14:51.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.83,0:15:03.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,He can't seriously intend\Nto stay there forever...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.04,0:15:36.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I will allow you to participate\Nin the basics of our training.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.25,0:15:38.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,But you must understand\Nthere is no guarantee
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.79,0:15:40.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,that you will actually learn a skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.00,0:15:44.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(883.2,194.4)}{\an7}3 Months After\N{\pos(870.4,244.8)}{\an7}Training Started
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.92,0:15:49.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,That is most certainly Low Heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.63,0:15:51.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,How is this even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.58,0:15:53.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.58,0:15:55.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, unfortunately for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.42,0:16:01.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Low Heal won't be recognized as a\Nserviceable skill to become an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.42,0:16:02.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,That figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.79,0:16:05.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I didn't have any luck here, either...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.96,0:16:09.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Although it only works on scratches,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.50,0:16:15.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,it's impressive you can use low-level\Nhealing magic without a natural blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.42,0:16:21.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,He performed a miracle on his own
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.17,0:16:24.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,without undergoing the rite or using\Na holy spirit for an intermediary...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.17,0:16:26.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, in a manner of speaking,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.46,0:16:30.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,that means he can wield the\Npower of miracles without limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.71,0:16:36.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Master Sain! About Noor...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.17,0:16:41.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's disappeared from the capital?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.17,0:16:44.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I should have stopped him yesterday...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.88,0:16:46.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, we can just leave him be, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.92,0:16:49.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,That kid's strong enough\Nto hack it on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.71,0:16:50.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.79,0:16:52.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,If we invest our time\Nin nurturing his gifts,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.67,0:16:56.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,then that boy will undoubtedly\Nbecome someone extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.29,0:16:57.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh ho...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.63,0:16:59.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're right about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.50,0:17:03.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I never imagined he was going through\Nthe same thing at all the other schools...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.21,0:17:08.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,We should all train him\Nand give him guidance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.63,0:17:10.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,That boy is overflowing with promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.92,0:17:13.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have no objection to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.92,0:17:15.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Although that makes it\Nmore difficult for me
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.46,0:17:17.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,to recruit him to\Nthe intelligence agency...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.63,0:17:19.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm of the same opinion as Sain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.42,0:17:21.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I am, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.92,0:17:23.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I guess if you guys insist...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.04,0:17:25.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,How about you, Sig?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.54,0:17:31.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm heading off on a journey\Nto find Noor now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.38,0:17:32.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey! Whoa, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.71,0:17:35.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I understand your eagerness,\Nbut please calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.21,0:17:38.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now then, just to be clear:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.88,0:17:42.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,As the Sovereign Six, we will take Noor in\Nand raise him as a group.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.08,0:17:43.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,You all agree, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.38,0:17:48.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then, let's get started\Nand look for him right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.29,0:17:59.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Noor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.08,0:18:02.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hello, sir, I'm glad you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.17,0:18:03.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, made it through somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.88,0:18:05.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,This was lying on the ground outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.46,0:18:08.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, I guess it flew off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.50,0:18:09.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.17,0:18:13.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Weren't you supposed to head to Mithra?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.92,0:18:17.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, but I guess you saw what was\Nhappening in the royal capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.08,0:18:20.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I turned around and rushed back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.13,0:18:23.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're all caked in mud.\NAnd your clothes are burned...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.79,0:18:27.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,It was a hectic day.\NI had to move around a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.63,0:18:29.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, that's a disaster for ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.58,0:18:31.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everybody's in the same boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.54,0:18:34.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I had an awful time, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.00,0:18:36.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm completely worn out too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.46,0:18:38.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,About that, Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.13,0:18:40.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hate to do this when you're so dog tired,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.13,0:18:45.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,but the construction guild boss\Nhas been searching high and low for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.00,0:18:47.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,He needs ya to haul away some rubble and\Nhelp build temporary housing and the like.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.13,0:18:50.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I figured that would be the case.\NThat's why I came.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.71,0:18:51.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.96,0:18:54.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll get you a map. Take it with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.29,0:19:03.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Having you here is a huge help!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.17,0:19:06.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,When you're here\Nour progress is off the charts!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.58,0:19:08.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Glad I can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.75,0:19:14.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,This really was a crazy day...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.96,0:19:18.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I went on a trip by carriage...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.00,0:19:20.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,met Rolo...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.25,0:19:26.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I got sent flying by Lynne's magic...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.46,0:19:33.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,and then I got sent flying\Nby Lynne's magic...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.46,0:19:34.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,A bunch of stuff happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.92,0:19:38.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,but getting sent flying by Lynne's magic\Nis what I remember the most...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.46,0:19:45.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm going to need some rest\Nand food pretty soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.33,0:19:49.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I can't afford to quit just yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.50,0:19:53.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've already noticed,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.92,0:19:57.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,but the Holy Theocracy of Mithra\Nwas working behind the scenes
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.25,0:19:59.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,with Deridas on this war.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.71,0:20:00.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.75,0:20:03.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,From the minotaur incident to the\NMagical Empire's weaponry,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.42,0:20:06.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,high purity mana-stones that can\Nonly be produced in that country
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.50,0:20:08.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,have been a factor at every possible turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.54,0:20:13.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Looking forward,\Nit seems our days won't be peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.83,0:20:19.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,However, there are people\Nour nation can depend on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.25,0:20:37.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,And most importantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.42,0:20:41.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,right now, we have that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.38,0:20:49.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks! Eat up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.75,0:20:55.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Instructor Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.13,0:20:58.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.00,0:20:59.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I should be thanking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.96,0:21:01.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,It was hard for you too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.42,0:21:04.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you handing out provisions?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.42,0:21:05.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.58,0:21:08.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm also treating those who are injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.00,0:21:10.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you here to help\Nwith the restoration work?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.88,0:21:11.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.50,0:21:23.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm handing these out to everyone,\Nso have one if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.42,0:21:24.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can I really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.79,0:21:26.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,By all means!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.00,0:21:27.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.17,0:21:32.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm going back to distributing these,\Nso goodbye for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.54,0:21:34.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay. Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.67,0:21:35.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.79,0:21:37.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't overwork yourself, Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.83,0:21:46.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Man, I really wouldn't be where I am\Nwithout everybody's help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.88,0:21:48.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.29,0:21:50.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can move much better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.96,0:21:54.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is a really good, sturdy sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.88,0:21:58.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Although it won't see much flashy action,\Nas long as I'm holding onto it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.96,0:22:04.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,But in spite of everything,\NI want to be an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.63,0:22:11.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want to go on adventures like the heroes\Nin the storybooks Dad read to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.88,0:22:16.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,For right now, let me put you\Nto good use here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.33,0:22:17.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Noor!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.54,0:22:20.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,We've cleared out enough in this area!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.38,0:22:23.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you good to keep working elsewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.67,0:22:24.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.33,0:22:34.33,Q4,,0,0,0,,#12 I Parry Everything
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.33,0:22:32.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.17,0:22:53.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess this is where\Nmy real work starts!
